>>
endobj
953 0 obj
<<
/Title (Star temperature and star radius were not very useful on their own.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 569 0 R
/Prev 1064 0 R
/Next 835 0 R
>>
endobj
954 0 obj
<<
/Title (We added three new features based on the physics of transits. None of them use the target label.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 836 0 R
>>
endobj
955 0 obj
<<
/Title (New feature n_koi_on_star)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 836 0 R
/Next 1065 0 R
>>
endobj
956 0 obj
<<
/Title (Ablation study)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1066 0 R
/First 1067 0 R
