<<
/Title (Very short periods \(under about 1.5 days\) were mostly false positives. We also saw a spike of false positives at around 370 days. We found out this is close to Kepler's own orbit around the Sun, so it is probably an instrument effect.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 569 0 R
/Prev 1063 0 R
