1133 0 obj
<<
/Title (Planet radius was by far the most important feature for XGBoost \(0.29 of the total importance\). After that came n_koi_on_star \(0.17\), period \(0.13\), radius_ratio \(0.11\) and duration_ratio \(0.09\). We were happy to see that three of the top five were features we created ourselves.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1066 0 R
/Next 1134 0 R
>>
endobj
