1138 0 obj
<<
/Title (Our new features helped, but only a little: about 0.004 in AUC and 0.7 percentage points in accuracy. Splitting by star also made very little difference here. This is because 89% of stars have only one KOI, so there was not much leakage to begin with. We still think splitting by star is the right approach, because it makes sure our results are not inflated.)
/Dest [20 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1068 0 R
/Prev 1161 0 R
>>
